flowchart TD
  A[User taps Voice UI\n(`AIAssistantSection`)] --> B{Mic Permission?}
  B -- Yes --> C[Start local STT (Web Speech API)\nInterim + final transcripts]
  B -- No --> F[Show typed fallback / request permission]
  C --> D[Client UX layer]
  D --> D1[Deduplicate & short-confirm handling]
  D --> D2[Persist draft → `localStorage`]
  D --> E{Confidence OK?}
  E -- High --> H[Use local transcript for intent extraction]
  E -- Low / Needs accuracy --> G[Stream audio → Deepgram (real-time ASR / diarization / punctuation / custom models)]
  G --> I[Deepgram returns enriched transcript + metadata]
  H --> J[Normalize transcript → structured fields (name/phone/service/date/time/confirm)]
  I --> J
  J --> K[/POST /ai/voice-book or /ai/voice-book/guest/]
  K --> L[Backend validate & check slots / business rules]
  L --> M{Create booking?}
  M -- Yes --> N[Create DB record (Booking) & persist transcript ref]
  N --> O[Send confirmation email (emailService.js) — mark: "Confirmed via Voice Assistant"]
  M -- No --> P[Return error / suggest alternatives]
  O --> Q[Return JSON success]
  P --> Q
  Q --> R[Client TTS announces result & updates UI]
  R --> S[User sees confirmation + email]
  T[Transcripts & metadata indexed] --- U[GROQ queries for context, search, analytics]